{{!
    @template enrol_apply/queue_filters

    The controls that narrow the applications queue: a filter bar holding the status control, the
    search box, the count and the Filters control, the Filters panel under it, then the chips.

    A GET form, rendered outside the decision form in manage.mustache: HTML forbids nested
    forms, so a search box inside the POST form would submit the decision instead.

    It carries the scope as a hidden field because a GET submit replaces the query string entirely
    rather than merging into it. It deliberately carries no paging or sorting parameters: core never
    clamps a stale page number, so keeping page three across a search that now matches four rows
    would render an empty table.

    The status is a segmented control (MQ-D3) whose values are links to this listing with that
    status and every other filter kept, so it works with scripting off; enrol_apply/manage takes
    the click over and refreshes the table instead. Its counts are the scope's and no filter changes
    them.

    The other filters live in the Filters panel, a native details element, so it opens and closes
    with scripting off and its fields stay in this one form; "Apply filters" in its foot submits
    them without JavaScript. It never renders open: it is a popover over the chip row, so the chips
    and the loud count say what is applied. The stylesheet lays it out as a panel under the bar.

    Every chip's remove control is a real link naming the filters that survive it, so the row works
    with scripting off.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none - the module attaches by data-region.

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-region="queuefilters" on the form, the module's root.
    * data-region="searchinput" on the search field.
    * data-region="statuscell" on each status value, carrying data-status (the status parameter's
      value, empty for every status) and aria-current="true" on the current one.
    * data-region="filterpanel" on the Filters panel, and data-region="filterpanelcount" on its
      loud counter, hidden when no panel filter is applied rather than omitted.
    * data-region="filterfield" on every control in the panel, each carrying data-filter (the token
      the query string and the filterset both use) and data-filterlabel (the wording a chip
      repeats), so the module needs no second copy of either.
    * data-emptyvalue on the group select, the value that means "every group": `all` where the page
      would otherwise apply its default, so the module writes it into the url instead of dropping
      the parameter; absent elsewhere, where the empty value means the same.
    * data-reloadonremove on the group select when core/form-autocomplete enhances it: its
      displayed selection is the enhancement's, which a value set from script does not redraw, so
      removing that filter follows the chip's link instead.
    * data-region="chiprow" on the chip row, which the module empties and refills.
    * data-region="clearall" on the clear-all link, hidden with d-none when nothing is applied
      rather than omitted, so the module has a node to unhide instead of one to invent; and
      data-region="clearfilters" on the panel's own "Clear filters", the same url.
    * data-region="filtercount" on the count line, carrying data-scopetotal - the count is
      "matched of total", the refreshed table reports only the matched half in its own
      data-table-total-rows, and the total is a property of the scope that no refresh changes.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * formaction string - url the GET form submits to
    * hasscope boolean - whether a scope id must ride along
    * scopeid int - the enrol instance id
    * hasviewtable boolean - whether the page is the method queue's table view (view=table), which
      the submit must keep, the grid being that queue's default page
    * searchlabel string - label of the search field, visually hidden, and its placeholder
    * searchvalue string - the term currently applied
    * searchhelp string - rendered help icon for the search field
    * statuslabel string - accessible name of the status control
    * statuscells array - value, label, count, current and url for each status value drawn
    * countnote string - "in your groups" for a reader narrowed to their groups, else empty
    * filterslabel string - accessible name of the Filters control
    * panelcount int - how many of the panel's filters are applied, 0 for none
    * hasgroupfilter bool - whether the group filter is offered: the instance queue, to a reader
      who may pick at least one group; see enrol_apply\local\groupfilter
    * grouplabel string - its label
    * groupoptions array - value, label and selected for each option, "Any group" first; the
      labels are the plain spelling
    * groupemptyvalue string - the value of "Any group": `all` where a default applies, else empty
    * groupsearch bool - whether core/form-autocomplete enhances the select (above 8 groups)
    * hascoursefilters bool - true on the site-wide queue, which is the only scope offering the
      course and category controls; see enrol_apply\local\coursefilter
    * categorylabel, courselabel string - the two labels
    * categoryoptions, courseoptions array - value, label and selected for each option. Both
      selects are enhanced by core/form-autocomplete with ajax off, so the list is rendered whole
      and the typing filters it in the browser.
    * haschips boolean - whether any filter is applied
    * chips array - name, value, removeurl and removelabel for each applied filter
    * clearurl string - url that removes every filter
    * clearlabel string - wording of the clear-all control
    * counttext string - how many applications match, of how many
    * scopetotal int - how many the queue holds before any filter, for the module to recount with
    * groupheading string - visually-hidden legend naming what the panel's controls do
    * hasfields boolean - whether any per-field filter is offered to this reader
    * fields array - token, label, inputid, isselect, value and options for each offered field
    * fromlabel, fromvalue, tolabel, tovalue - the applied-date bounds and their labels

    Example context (json): {
        "formaction": "https://example.com/enrol/apply/manage.php",
        "hasscope": true,
        "scopeid": 140,
        "hasviewtable": true,
        "searchlabel": "Search",
        "searchvalue": "goncalves",
        "searchhelp": "",
        "statuslabel": "Application status",
        "statuscells": [
            {"value": "", "label": "All", "count": 7, "current": true,
             "url": "https://example.com/enrol/apply/manage.php?id=140"},
            {"value": "1", "label": "Pending", "count": 5, "current": false,
             "url": "https://example.com/enrol/apply/manage.php?id=140&status=1"},
            {"value": "2", "label": "Deferred", "count": 2, "current": false,
             "url": "https://example.com/enrol/apply/manage.php?id=140&status=2"}
        ],
        "countnote": "in your groups",
        "filterslabel": "Filters",
        "panelcount": 2,
        "hasgroupfilter": true,
        "grouplabel": "Group",
        "groupoptions": [
            {"value": "all", "label": "Any group", "selected": false},
            {"value": "mine", "label": "My groups", "selected": false},
            {"value": "none", "label": "Without a group", "selected": false},
            {"value": "12", "label": "Turma A", "selected": true}
        ],
        "groupemptyvalue": "all",
        "groupsearch": false,
        "hascoursefilters": true,
        "categorylabel": "Course category",
        "categoryoptions": [
            {"value": "", "label": "Any category", "selected": true},
            {"value": "3", "label": "Engineering", "selected": false}
        ],
        "courselabel": "Course",
        "courseoptions": [
            {"value": "", "label": "Any course", "selected": true},
            {"value": "7", "label": "Structural mechanics", "selected": false}
        ],
        "haschips": true,
        "chips": [
            {
                "filter": "search",
                "name": "Search",
                "value": "goncalves",
                "removeurl": "https://example.com/enrol/apply/manage.php?id=140",
                "removelabel": "Remove the filter Search: goncalves"
            }
        ],
        "clearurl": "https://example.com/enrol/apply/manage.php?id=140",
        "clearlabel": "Clear all",
        "counttext": "4 of 312 applications",
        "scopetotal": 312,
        "groupheading": "Narrow the queue",
        "hasfields": true,
        "fields": [
            {
                "token": "city",
                "label": "City/town",
                "inputid": "enrol_apply_filter_city",
                "isselect": false,
                "value": "Ouro Preto",
                "options": []
            },
            {
                "token": "country",
                "label": "Country",
                "inputid": "enrol_apply_filter_country",
                "isselect": true,
                "value": "BR",
                "options": [
                    {"value": "BR", "label": "Brazil", "selected": true},
                    {"value": "PT", "label": "Portugal", "selected": false}
                ]
            }
        ],
        "fromlabel": "Applied from",
        "fromvalue": "2026-08-01",
        "tolabel": "Applied to",
        "tovalue": ""
    }
}}
<form method="get" action="{{formaction}}" class="enrol_apply-filters mb-3" data-region="queuefilters">
    {{#hasscope}}<input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{scopeid}}">{{/hasscope}}
    {{#hasviewtable}}<input type="hidden" name="view" value="table">{{/hasviewtable}}
    <div class="enrol_apply-filterbar">
        <div class="enrol_apply-seg" role="group" aria-label="{{statuslabel}}">
            {{#statuscells}}
                <a class="enrol_apply-seg-cell" href="{{url}}" data-region="statuscell" data-status="{{value}}"
                   {{#current}}aria-current="true"{{/current}}><span class="enrol_apply-seg-label">{{label}}</span>
                    <small class="enrol_apply-seg-count">{{count}}</small></a>
            {{/statuscells}}
        </div>
        {{#countnote}}<span class="enrol_apply-segnote small text-muted">{{countnote}}</span>{{/countnote}}
        <div class="enrol_apply-searchfield">
            <label class="visually-hidden" for="enrol_apply_search">{{searchlabel}}</label>
            <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="enrol_apply_search" name="search"
                   value="{{searchvalue}}" placeholder="{{searchlabel}}" data-region="searchinput" autocomplete="off">
            {{{searchhelp}}}
        </div>
        <span class="enrol_apply-filtercount" data-region="filtercount"
              data-scopetotal="{{scopetotal}}" aria-live="polite">{{counttext}}</span>
        <details class="enrol_apply-filterpanel" data-region="filterpanel">
            <summary class="enrol_apply-filterstoggle">
                {{#pix}} i/filter, core {{/pix}}<span class="visually-hidden">{{filterslabel}}</span>
                <span class="enrol_apply-filtersbadge" data-region="filterpanelcount"
                      {{^panelcount}}hidden{{/panelcount}}>{{panelcount}}</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="enrol_apply-filterpanel-body">
                <fieldset class="enrol_apply-filterrow">
                    <legend class="visually-hidden">{{groupheading}}</legend>
                    {{#hasgroupfilter}}
                        <div class="enrol_apply-filterfield">
                            <label class="form-label" for="enrol_apply_filter_group">{{grouplabel}}</label>
                            <select class="form-select form-select-sm" id="enrol_apply_filter_group" name="group"
                                    data-region="filterfield" data-filter="group" data-filterlabel="{{grouplabel}}"
                                    {{#groupemptyvalue}}data-emptyvalue="{{groupemptyvalue}}"{{/groupemptyvalue}}
                                    {{#groupsearch}}data-reloadonremove="1"{{/groupsearch}}>
                                {{#groupoptions}}
                                    <option value="{{value}}" {{#selected}}selected{{/selected}}>{{label}}</option>
                                {{/groupoptions}}
                            </select>
                        </div>
                    {{/hasgroupfilter}}
                    {{#hascoursefilters}}
                        <div class="enrol_apply-filterfield">
                            <label class="form-label" for="enrol_apply_category">{{categorylabel}}</label>
                            <select class="form-select form-select-sm" id="enrol_apply_category" name="category"
                                    data-region="filterfield" data-filter="category" data-filterlabel="{{categorylabel}}">
                                {{#categoryoptions}}
                                    <option value="{{value}}" {{#selected}}selected{{/selected}}>{{label}}</option>
                                {{/categoryoptions}}
                            </select>
                        </div>
                        <div class="enrol_apply-filterfield">
                            <label class="form-label" for="enrol_apply_course">{{courselabel}}</label>
                            <select class="form-select form-select-sm" id="enrol_apply_course" name="course"
                                    data-region="filterfield" data-filter="course" data-filterlabel="{{courselabel}}">
                                {{#courseoptions}}
                                    <option value="{{value}}" {{#selected}}selected{{/selected}}>{{label}}</option>
                                {{/courseoptions}}
                            </select>
                        </div>
                    {{/hascoursefilters}}
                    {{#fields}}
                        <div class="enrol_apply-filterfield">
                            <label class="form-label" for="{{inputid}}">{{label}}</label>
                            {{#isselect}}
                                <select class="form-select form-select-sm" id="{{inputid}}" name="{{token}}"
                                        data-region="filterfield" data-filter="{{token}}" data-filterlabel="{{label}}">
                                    <option value="">{{#str}}choosedots, core{{/str}}</option>
                                    {{#options}}
                                        <option value="{{value}}" {{#selected}}selected{{/selected}}>{{label}}</option>
                                    {{/options}}
                                </select>
                            {{/isselect}}
                            {{^isselect}}
                                <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="{{inputid}}" name="{{token}}"
                                       value="{{value}}" autocomplete="off"
                                       data-region="filterfield" data-filter="{{token}}" data-filterlabel="{{label}}">
                            {{/isselect}}
                        </div>
                    {{/fields}}
                    <div class="enrol_apply-filterfield">
                        <label class="form-label" for="enrol_apply_appliedfrom">{{fromlabel}}</label>
                        <input type="date" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="enrol_apply_appliedfrom"
                               name="appliedfrom" value="{{fromvalue}}" data-region="filterfield" data-filter="appliedfrom"
                               data-filterlabel="{{fromlabel}}">
                    </div>
                    <div class="enrol_apply-filterfield">
                        <label class="form-label" for="enrol_apply_appliedto">{{tolabel}}</label>
                        <input type="date" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="enrol_apply_appliedto"
                               name="appliedto" value="{{tovalue}}" data-region="filterfield" data-filter="appliedto"
                               data-filterlabel="{{tolabel}}">
                    </div>
                </fieldset>
                <div class="enrol_apply-filterpanel-foot">
                    <a href="{{clearurl}}" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary"
                       data-region="clearfilters">{{#str}}clearfilters, core{{/str}}</a>
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary">{{#str}}applyfilters, core{{/str}}</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </details>
    </div>
    <div class="enrol_apply-chiprow" data-region="chiprow">
        {{#chips}}
            {{> enrol_apply/queue_chip }}
        {{/chips}}
        <a href="{{clearurl}}" class="enrol_apply-clearall small {{^haschips}}d-none{{/haschips}}"
           data-region="clearall">{{clearlabel}}</a>
    </div>
</form>
